1
00:00:01,357 --> 00:00:03,527
[♪ upbeat music playing]

2
00:00:29,637 --> 00:00:31,557
- Hey, man.
- Morimo, what's up?

3
00:00:31,597 --> 00:00:33,557
[both grunting]

4
00:00:33,597 --> 00:00:35,477
- [Morimo laughing]
- Hey!

5
00:00:35,517 --> 00:00:36,727
- Morning.
- Hey!

6
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:38,647
- [YAMADA] It's-a Mini!
- What are you doing?

7
00:00:38,727 --> 00:00:40,897
[MORIMO] Schoolin' this guy.

8
00:00:40,897 --> 00:00:43,737
- Whoa. Cool.
- Yeah. See?

9
00:00:51,737 --> 00:00:52,907
[smacks lips]

10
00:00:59,167 --> 00:01:01,127
[yawning]

11
00:01:13,347 --> 00:01:14,977
Hmm...

12
00:01:15,937 --> 00:01:17,767
[groans]

13
00:01:19,267 --> 00:01:21,817
[inhales deeply]
What's up, Tani?

14
00:01:21,897 --> 00:01:24,067
Mmm-mmm, mmm-mmm.

15
00:01:24,897 --> 00:01:26,357
How's it hangin'?

16
00:01:26,397 --> 00:01:28,107
- Ugh! Creepy.
- [exclaims]

17
00:01:28,157 --> 00:01:29,317
Eat a chainsaw!

18
00:01:29,367 --> 00:01:31,327
[SONG] Move or I crush
your donut hair.

19
00:01:31,367 --> 00:01:32,787
[SUZUKI] Ugh, I hate you!

20
00:01:32,827 --> 00:01:35,407
Knock it off and get moving!
You're going to be late.

21
00:01:36,537 --> 00:01:37,997
[SUZUKI] I'm outie.

22
00:01:52,927 --> 00:01:55,017
[indistinct chatter]

23
00:01:55,637 --> 00:01:57,137
Morning, Suzuki.

24
00:01:57,187 --> 00:01:59,647
Azuma and Taira
walking together.

25
00:01:59,687 --> 00:02:00,727
Dude! Shut up!

26
00:02:00,807 --> 00:02:02,647
[SUZUKI] Watanabe.
Satou. Nabesato.

27
00:02:02,687 --> 00:02:03,727
- Hi!
- Hey. 'Sup?

28
00:02:03,817 --> 00:02:05,397
[SUZUKI] Good morning, Yamada.

29
00:02:05,437 --> 00:02:06,527
Yo!

30
00:02:06,567 --> 00:02:07,737
Uh, hey.

31
00:02:07,817 --> 00:02:09,657
Good morning to ya, Tani.

32
00:02:13,697 --> 00:02:15,117
Morning.

33
00:02:15,497 --> 00:02:17,497
[giggling]

34
00:02:17,537 --> 00:02:19,497
Oh, my God, why are you
screaming at him?

35
00:02:19,537 --> 00:02:21,457
I'm saving the world
one "hi" at a time.

36
00:02:21,497 --> 00:02:24,127
Look, I made my lashes
extra lashy.

37
00:02:24,127 --> 00:02:26,667
- Hmm. Did you?
- [giggles, groans]

38
00:02:26,707 --> 00:02:28,377
Why don't you just use falsies?

39
00:02:28,417 --> 00:02:31,137
I generally prefer
rocking the real thing,

40
00:02:31,177 --> 00:02:33,467
working with the eyelashes
my mama gave me

41
00:02:33,507 --> 00:02:34,557
and all that jazz.

42
00:02:34,597 --> 00:02:36,517
But mascara is risky AF.

43
00:02:36,557 --> 00:02:39,437
If you sweat or cry or rub it,
you're DOA.

44
00:02:39,477 --> 00:02:41,347
I'm still on an eternal quest

45
00:02:41,397 --> 00:02:43,017
to find the perfect formula
for me.

46
00:02:43,057 --> 00:02:46,147
But I'm fighting the good fight,
so whatevs.

47
00:02:46,527 --> 00:02:47,897
Any thoughts, Tani?

48
00:02:49,567 --> 00:02:51,777
I don't know anything
about makeup.

49
00:02:51,857 --> 00:02:53,657
[laughs enthusiastically]

50
00:02:53,697 --> 00:02:55,447
You're savage as ever, Tani.

51
00:02:55,487 --> 00:02:56,867
I totally love it!

52
00:02:56,867 --> 00:02:59,157
Why do you get such a kick
out of pestering Tani

53
00:02:59,207 --> 00:03:01,287
about things
he clearly has no interest in?

54
00:03:01,327 --> 00:03:02,707
Girl, chill.

55
00:03:02,747 --> 00:03:04,247
[Suzuki giggles] I love the way
he shuts me down.

56
00:03:04,287 --> 00:03:06,497
I can't help myself.
[giggling continues]

57
00:03:06,997 --> 00:03:08,717
If you ever need help
picking mascara,

58
00:03:08,757 --> 00:03:10,587
- come to me, okay?
- [TANI] I won't.

59
00:03:10,627 --> 00:03:13,047
Another slam
of the verbal door!

60
00:03:13,047 --> 00:03:14,347
He's ruthless.

61
00:03:14,387 --> 00:03:16,387
Stop bothering the poor guy.

62
00:03:17,057 --> 00:03:19,227
[giggles weakly]

63
00:03:19,767 --> 00:03:21,187
Mmm...

64
00:03:21,227 --> 00:03:22,937
I'm sorry, Tani.

65
00:03:23,267 --> 00:03:26,017
I know I always end up
yapping your ear off,

66
00:03:26,317 --> 00:03:27,777
but the truth is...

67
00:03:28,897 --> 00:03:31,777
[dramatically] I'm desperately
in love with you.

68
00:03:31,817 --> 00:03:34,027
[♪ opening theme song playing]

69
00:05:03,287 --> 00:05:05,157
Hey, did you finish
your homework?

70
00:05:05,157 --> 00:05:07,877
I only did the parts that
I thought I might get right.

71
00:05:07,917 --> 00:05:09,167
Dude, do the whole thing.

72
00:05:09,877 --> 00:05:12,917
[SUZUKI] Sitting in the seat
next to me is Tani.

73
00:05:13,007 --> 00:05:14,467
To everybody else in our class,

74
00:05:14,507 --> 00:05:16,627
he's just a cookie-cutter,
glasses-wearing,

75
00:05:16,677 --> 00:05:18,887
quiet dude who always
keeps to himself.

76
00:05:19,887 --> 00:05:21,927
But when he does speak,
he speaks his mind.

77
00:05:22,887 --> 00:05:25,017
Here, she's going to
flag this part

78
00:05:25,017 --> 00:05:26,307
if you don't fix it.

79
00:05:26,307 --> 00:05:28,307
[YAMADA] Come on.
C's get degrees, my dude.

80
00:05:28,347 --> 00:05:30,187
[SUZUKI] And he has
the same attitude

81
00:05:30,227 --> 00:05:31,937
no matter who he's with.

82
00:05:32,897 --> 00:05:33,937
Have the homework?

83
00:05:36,897 --> 00:05:38,197
- Homework?
- Yeah. Thanks for grabbing them.

84
00:05:38,237 --> 00:05:39,527
Thank you. Tani.

85
00:05:39,567 --> 00:05:42,617
[SUZUKI] Like the last time
we changed seats.

86
00:05:44,197 --> 00:05:45,827
Now run along to your new spot.

87
00:05:50,037 --> 00:05:52,587
[hyperventilating]

88
00:05:56,337 --> 00:05:57,927
I'm right next to him.

89
00:05:57,967 --> 00:06:00,337
This is wild! What do I do?!

90
00:06:01,847 --> 00:06:04,057
Holler if you need
a cup of sugar, neighbor.

91
00:06:04,097 --> 00:06:05,467
[TANI] Likewise.

92
00:06:05,517 --> 00:06:06,977
[SUZUKI] Front row seats.
Look at us.

93
00:06:07,977 --> 00:06:10,057
Reading the blackboard from here
is harder than you'd think.

94
00:06:10,057 --> 00:06:11,227
But I got you.

95
00:06:11,267 --> 00:06:12,897
I'll read anything
you can't make out,

96
00:06:12,937 --> 00:06:14,357
so don't break your neck.

97
00:06:14,397 --> 00:06:15,607
I'll be okay.

98
00:06:15,647 --> 00:06:17,487
[Suzuki giggles nervously]
Okie-dokie.

99
00:06:18,197 --> 00:06:21,067
Tani doesn't change
who he is for anybody.

100
00:06:21,737 --> 00:06:23,367
[SATOU] Live has more character.

101
00:06:23,367 --> 00:06:24,987
[SUZUKI] I think
that's awesome.

102
00:06:25,077 --> 00:06:26,657
I really admire him.

103
00:06:26,697 --> 00:06:29,367
[WATANABE] Suzuki,
which do you prefer?

104
00:06:29,367 --> 00:06:30,997
Sorry, I zoned out for a little.

105
00:06:31,077 --> 00:06:32,077
Oh, my God.

106
00:06:32,077 --> 00:06:33,877
[clears throat] In my opinion,

107
00:06:33,917 --> 00:06:35,917
a real-life person
can rev up a crowd

108
00:06:35,957 --> 00:06:38,377
way better than some
dumb recording ever could.

109
00:06:38,377 --> 00:06:41,007
- Tell 'em, Tani!
- I have no clue.

110
00:06:41,087 --> 00:06:43,257
Sorry about her.
She's certifiable.

111
00:06:43,257 --> 00:06:45,307
If she's bothering you,
just let us know.

112
00:06:45,387 --> 00:06:46,387
[Suzuki grunts]

113
00:06:48,097 --> 00:06:49,847
I don't mind at all.

114
00:06:49,887 --> 00:06:50,897
[gasps]

115
00:06:51,597 --> 00:06:53,897
See? He says he doesn't mind.

116
00:06:54,897 --> 00:06:56,397
Ohh! Oh, thank God!

117
00:06:57,027 --> 00:06:58,737
I'm so sorry, Tani.

118
00:06:58,777 --> 00:07:00,027
I love you,

119
00:07:00,107 --> 00:07:02,277
and I want to talk
to you normally.

120
00:07:02,697 --> 00:07:05,737
I'm just always in my head
about how people see me,

121
00:07:05,787 --> 00:07:07,287
so I can't talk to you

122
00:07:07,287 --> 00:07:09,247
in a way
that reveals my feelings.

123
00:07:09,657 --> 00:07:12,247
I admire the crap
out of you, dude,

124
00:07:12,287 --> 00:07:15,667
but you and I
are polar opposites.

125
00:07:16,247 --> 00:07:19,297
Okay. After school,
let's go to KingBurg.

126
00:07:19,337 --> 00:07:20,837
Hey. Dining with us, ding-dong?

127
00:07:20,877 --> 00:07:22,127
Uh...

128
00:07:22,127 --> 00:07:23,927
I need to do my homework.

129
00:07:25,137 --> 00:07:29,347
[WATANABE] Hmm? Hmm?
Hmm? Hmm?

130
00:07:29,427 --> 00:07:31,687
[SUZUKI] Vamonos
a la Burg!

131
00:07:31,727 --> 00:07:32,767
[BOTH] Yay!

132
00:07:34,147 --> 00:07:35,437
Hey, Suzuki.

133
00:07:35,437 --> 00:07:38,437
- Can I copy your homework?
- Again?

134
00:07:38,437 --> 00:07:40,317
- [YAMADA] Please save me.
- [groans]

135
00:07:40,777 --> 00:07:42,607
You're hopeless. Here.

136
00:07:42,657 --> 00:07:44,067
[YAMADA] Thank you!

137
00:07:44,527 --> 00:07:45,737
Oh, Suzuki.

138
00:07:45,777 --> 00:07:48,077
The story you posted
made me laugh out loud.

139
00:07:48,157 --> 00:07:50,447
Aw, can I follow your account
so I can see it too?

140
00:07:50,497 --> 00:07:53,037
[SUZUKI] I didn't post
anything weird, did I?

141
00:07:53,077 --> 00:07:55,877
Of course, girly-swirly.
You go for it.

142
00:07:56,377 --> 00:07:59,917
[YAMADA] Did you know?
Tani is, like, really smart.

143
00:07:59,957 --> 00:08:01,167
[coughing]

144
00:08:01,167 --> 00:08:03,467
He totally carried our group.

145
00:08:03,507 --> 00:08:05,587
I've seen him shuffling off
to cram school.

146
00:08:05,637 --> 00:08:07,887
[WATANABE] Think he's gunning
for UTokyo?

147
00:08:07,927 --> 00:08:09,347
[TAIRA] How should I know?

148
00:08:09,387 --> 00:08:10,977
[laughs awkwardly] That guy
has got serious promise.

149
00:08:11,017 --> 00:08:13,017
I feel like he lives
in a different world

150
00:08:13,057 --> 00:08:14,097
from the rest of us.

151
00:08:14,187 --> 00:08:15,727
[SATOU] Do not
lump me in with you.

152
00:08:15,767 --> 00:08:16,857
Out of everybody here,

153
00:08:16,897 --> 00:08:19,067
Suzuki probably knows him
the best.

154
00:08:19,607 --> 00:08:21,737
Oh, yeah? You really think so?

155
00:08:21,777 --> 00:08:22,897
[slurps, coughs]

156
00:08:23,487 --> 00:08:25,907
- Ew! Plague!
- Are you gonna make it?

157
00:08:25,947 --> 00:08:27,777
[coughs, laughs] I'm A-okay.

158
00:08:27,827 --> 00:08:29,537
I just gotta space out
my talking

159
00:08:29,577 --> 00:08:31,907
- and my sipping better.
- Don't die on us.

160
00:08:31,947 --> 00:08:33,037
Aw!

161
00:08:33,997 --> 00:08:35,747
SudaKen just won
Most Beloved Actor

162
00:08:35,787 --> 00:08:37,127
for the second time.

163
00:08:37,167 --> 00:08:39,417
[laughs] You chicks always go
for the bad boys.

164
00:08:39,457 --> 00:08:42,127
No, doy! SudaKen is, like,
beyond boyfriend material.

165
00:08:42,167 --> 00:08:45,007
[WATANABE] You're always
the ultimate SudaKen stan.

166
00:08:45,047 --> 00:08:47,597
[cackling]

167
00:08:47,637 --> 00:08:49,007
They say reading the room

168
00:08:49,057 --> 00:08:51,217
is to protect
other people's feelings.

169
00:08:51,217 --> 00:08:52,557
But in my case...

170
00:08:54,347 --> 00:08:57,097
I totally do it
to protect my own.

171
00:09:05,527 --> 00:09:06,737
And yet...

172
00:09:07,947 --> 00:09:10,407
all I feel is exhausted.

173
00:09:10,407 --> 00:09:12,117
Why is that?

174
00:09:12,157 --> 00:09:14,907
- [GROUP] Fight! Win!
- [BOY 1] Go! Fight! Win!

175
00:09:15,657 --> 00:09:16,787
[sighs]

176
00:09:16,827 --> 00:09:19,747
[BOY 1] Go! Fight! Fight! Win!

177
00:09:19,787 --> 00:09:21,747
[SUZUKI] I should head home.

178
00:09:21,797 --> 00:09:22,917
[door closes]

179
00:09:25,587 --> 00:09:29,427
[yawning loudly]

180
00:09:30,427 --> 00:09:31,717
[exclaims]

181
00:09:32,177 --> 00:09:35,847
Oh, hey, Tani. It's pretty late.
Why are you doing here?

182
00:09:36,307 --> 00:09:38,897
My face probably
looked hideous just now.

183
00:09:39,767 --> 00:09:41,817
I needed to turn in
my committee work.

184
00:09:41,857 --> 00:09:44,987
Not to be weird, but which way
do you walk home?

185
00:09:45,027 --> 00:09:47,027
I take a right at the gate.

186
00:09:47,067 --> 00:09:48,107
Same here!

187
00:09:48,157 --> 00:09:49,447
Okay. No one's watching.

188
00:09:51,487 --> 00:09:53,947
[hesitates] Hey, Tani.

189
00:09:55,077 --> 00:09:56,957
Oh, don't do it.

190
00:09:59,207 --> 00:10:01,957
Would you mind
if I walked along with you?

191
00:10:01,997 --> 00:10:04,757
Oh, you did it!
Oh, God, I'm gonna puke!

192
00:10:06,467 --> 00:10:08,087
It is madness

193
00:10:08,127 --> 00:10:09,587
we live in the same direction.

194
00:10:09,637 --> 00:10:11,967
Strange we've never
run into each other before.

195
00:10:12,847 --> 00:10:13,967
[TANI] Mmm.

196
00:10:19,597 --> 00:10:21,017
Doy!

197
00:10:21,057 --> 00:10:22,817
I'm always running around
goofing off after school.

198
00:10:22,857 --> 00:10:24,477
Of course I don't see you.

199
00:10:24,527 --> 00:10:25,607
And you stay busy with

200
00:10:25,607 --> 00:10:27,487
the student council
stuff, right?

201
00:10:28,607 --> 00:10:29,607
[TANI] Right.

202
00:10:38,207 --> 00:10:39,497
Oh!

203
00:10:39,537 --> 00:10:41,627
We decided to swing by
KingBurg the other day,

204
00:10:41,667 --> 00:10:43,087
and they gave me a burger.

205
00:10:43,127 --> 00:10:45,497
It was so flippin' big,
it was sliding off the bun.

206
00:10:45,547 --> 00:10:47,717
It was more like I ordered meat
with bun on the side.

207
00:10:47,757 --> 00:10:50,927
I had no idea how to eat it
without looking like a weirdo.

208
00:10:52,047 --> 00:10:53,887
Is this interesting at all?

209
00:10:54,347 --> 00:10:55,557
[TANI] Was it good?

210
00:10:56,677 --> 00:10:58,517
Oh, yeah. Like, crazy good.
Loved it!

211
00:10:59,477 --> 00:11:02,517
You know, if you want to,
we could go grab one together.

212
00:11:02,557 --> 00:11:03,857
JK!

213
00:11:03,897 --> 00:11:04,977
Okay.

214
00:11:07,027 --> 00:11:08,107
Huh?

215
00:11:08,527 --> 00:11:10,277
Did he just say yes?

216
00:11:11,197 --> 00:11:12,947
Is he being polite?

217
00:11:12,987 --> 00:11:14,277
Matching my vibe?

218
00:11:17,407 --> 00:11:18,657
No way.

219
00:11:18,697 --> 00:11:20,787
Tani isn't
that kind of person.

220
00:11:24,287 --> 00:11:25,377
[groans softly]

221
00:11:28,877 --> 00:11:30,377
I've gotta think.

222
00:11:30,377 --> 00:11:33,297
Think, girl. Your window
to reply is closing!

223
00:11:33,387 --> 00:11:34,547
- It's no use.
- [heart pounding]

224
00:11:34,597 --> 00:11:36,967
My heart is pounding
way too hard!

225
00:11:37,007 --> 00:11:38,137
I can't do it!

226
00:11:40,977 --> 00:11:43,187
[squeals] Oh, um, I'm sorry!

227
00:11:45,557 --> 00:11:47,187
[giggling nervously]

228
00:12:06,837 --> 00:12:09,707
[♪ dreamy music playing]

229
00:12:10,127 --> 00:12:11,717
[gasps]

230
00:12:17,467 --> 00:12:18,967
It can't be.

231
00:12:20,137 --> 00:12:21,767
Am I...

232
00:12:21,807 --> 00:12:23,437
dreaming right now?

233
00:12:24,647 --> 00:12:26,647
Is this real life?

234
00:12:27,147 --> 00:12:29,647
He's holding my hand.

235
00:12:29,727 --> 00:12:32,737
My sweaty, sweaty hand.

236
00:12:33,277 --> 00:12:35,987
And my heart is pounding
in my ears.

237
00:12:36,027 --> 00:12:38,277
Like, really pounding.

238
00:12:38,327 --> 00:12:39,657
Like, what if I die?

239
00:12:39,737 --> 00:12:41,157
[GIRL 1] Did you catch that?

240
00:12:41,197 --> 00:12:43,657
He was seriously on one today.

241
00:12:43,747 --> 00:12:45,167
[GIRL 2] And he thought
he was being chill!

242
00:12:45,207 --> 00:12:46,747
[GIRL 1] It's sad.

243
00:12:46,747 --> 00:12:49,627
Some people just have
zero social awareness.

244
00:12:52,757 --> 00:12:54,007
[SUZUKI] After that is a blur.

245
00:12:54,047 --> 00:12:55,177
I THINK WE PROBABLY SAID
SOMETHING LIKE THIS.

246
00:12:58,257 --> 00:12:59,387
I have no idea how I got home.

247
00:13:00,757 --> 00:13:03,807
[Song humming]
I'm ho-- [screams]

248
00:13:04,807 --> 00:13:06,267
You have a bedroom, you freak!

249
00:13:06,307 --> 00:13:07,477
Right.

250
00:13:07,807 --> 00:13:09,267
Forgot.

251
00:13:09,937 --> 00:13:11,607
[gasps, screams]

252
00:13:11,647 --> 00:13:12,897
[SONG] Good Lord.

253
00:13:14,777 --> 00:13:17,777
[SUZUKI] We... held hands.

254
00:13:17,777 --> 00:13:19,277
[SUZUKI'S MOTHER]
Aren't you going to eat?

255
00:13:19,327 --> 00:13:21,117
If you're not,
then I'll help you.

256
00:13:21,907 --> 00:13:23,537
[SUZUKI] Not only that.

257
00:13:23,617 --> 00:13:25,327
He started it!

258
00:13:25,657 --> 00:13:27,117
That was crazy. And he's crazy.

259
00:13:27,167 --> 00:13:28,497
And I'm going crazy.

260
00:13:28,497 --> 00:13:29,837
How the flip am I supposed
to go to school

261
00:13:29,877 --> 00:13:31,297
and act like a human being?!

262
00:13:31,337 --> 00:13:33,257
I'm never gonna go to sleep.

263
00:13:33,297 --> 00:13:35,547
My heart is trying to beat
through my chest !

264
00:13:35,627 --> 00:13:36,677
[screams]

265
00:13:39,137 --> 00:13:41,217
[SONG] Shut up!

266
00:13:49,397 --> 00:13:51,517
[birds chirping]

267
00:13:54,397 --> 00:13:56,697
[weakly] I need to get bumpers.

268
00:13:56,737 --> 00:13:59,027
The heck it so bright for?

269
00:13:59,067 --> 00:14:00,697
Can't be morning already.

270
00:14:01,577 --> 00:14:02,697
Huh?

271
00:14:03,117 --> 00:14:04,197
[gasps]

272
00:14:04,697 --> 00:14:05,827
[screaming]

273
00:14:05,867 --> 00:14:07,867
I haven't been absent
or tardy all year!

274
00:14:09,827 --> 00:14:11,417
Hello? Family?!

275
00:14:15,257 --> 00:14:16,547
Come on, Mom!

276
00:14:16,587 --> 00:14:19,337
Late is one thing,
but it's practically midday!

277
00:14:22,097 --> 00:14:24,467
Well, guess there's no point
rushing now.

278
00:14:24,557 --> 00:14:26,597
Come here.

279
00:14:28,727 --> 00:14:31,397
It's lunchtime,
but good morning!

280
00:14:31,437 --> 00:14:33,107
[SATOU] You're never this late.

281
00:14:33,147 --> 00:14:35,727
Yeesh. You should have
taken the day off.

282
00:14:35,777 --> 00:14:37,737
I know, but I didn't want
to miss P.E.

283
00:14:37,737 --> 00:14:38,987
Okay, weirdo.

284
00:14:42,067 --> 00:14:43,777
Look who finally showed.

285
00:14:43,867 --> 00:14:45,037
[SUZUKI] At long last.

286
00:14:45,077 --> 00:14:47,617
Hey, so I've got
a question for you.

287
00:14:47,697 --> 00:14:49,747
Are you and Tani,
like, a thing now?

288
00:14:50,247 --> 00:14:51,327
Huh?

289
00:14:52,287 --> 00:14:54,917
Yeah. Gapacho said he saw you
walking home together,

290
00:14:54,957 --> 00:14:56,167
so I thought I should ask.

291
00:14:56,207 --> 00:14:57,707
[SUZUKI] Who the eff
is Gapacho?

292
00:14:57,757 --> 00:14:59,257
That's not a real person.

293
00:14:59,297 --> 00:15:01,177
[YAMADA] Gapacho is real,
and he knows what he saw.

294
00:15:01,217 --> 00:15:02,887
- Sure thing, dude.
- [SUZUKI] Whoa!

295
00:15:02,887 --> 00:15:05,217
Slow your freaking roll
there, Yamada!

296
00:15:05,257 --> 00:15:07,717
Right now, Tani and I are in
the might-be-mutual,

297
00:15:07,767 --> 00:15:09,887
but-not-yet-confirmed phase
of liking each other.

298
00:15:09,937 --> 00:15:11,187
The most delicate, fragile,

299
00:15:11,227 --> 00:15:12,767
super freaking important
phase of all.

300
00:15:12,807 --> 00:15:14,817
It's not something
you could just poke fun at,

301
00:15:14,897 --> 00:15:15,817
you big rube!

302
00:15:15,897 --> 00:15:18,397
I am playing for keeps here!

303
00:15:18,437 --> 00:15:20,317
Also... what?

304
00:15:20,357 --> 00:15:23,157
- Somebody saw us?
- Hello?

305
00:15:23,657 --> 00:15:26,077
[SUZUKI] Saw us where?

306
00:15:26,487 --> 00:15:29,077
[laughing awkwardly] I, uh...

307
00:15:31,497 --> 00:15:33,167
[quivering]

308
00:15:36,627 --> 00:15:38,667
It's not like that, dude!

309
00:15:39,167 --> 00:15:40,337
Excuse me.

310
00:15:41,677 --> 00:15:44,257
Hey, that's my seat.

311
00:15:44,297 --> 00:15:46,807
[groans]

312
00:15:47,257 --> 00:15:48,387
I need my notebook.

313
00:15:48,427 --> 00:15:50,477
[YAMADA] Oops.
Sorry, man. I'll move.

314
00:15:50,517 --> 00:15:51,477
It's fine.

315
00:15:51,517 --> 00:15:53,557
- The period's over.
- Oh.

316
00:15:56,817 --> 00:15:58,317
[Suzuki whimpers]

317
00:16:01,987 --> 00:16:03,067
Oh.

318
00:16:03,107 --> 00:16:06,197
That could not have been worse.

319
00:16:08,487 --> 00:16:11,537
[TEACHER] Our main source
of energy is carbohydrates.

320
00:16:11,577 --> 00:16:13,457
[SUZUKI] He heard me denying
anything between us

321
00:16:13,497 --> 00:16:15,247
like I was accused of a felony!

322
00:16:16,497 --> 00:16:18,667
I was crazy rude.

323
00:16:19,087 --> 00:16:20,957
[exclaims] You've got it wrong!

324
00:16:20,957 --> 00:16:22,877
I didn't mean for it
to come out like that!

325
00:16:22,967 --> 00:16:24,337
I'm sorry, Tani, I...

326
00:16:27,797 --> 00:16:30,057
No, no!
I literally could never.

327
00:16:30,097 --> 00:16:33,097
But I need to apologize
ASAGDMFP!

328
00:16:34,187 --> 00:16:36,357
What do I do?

329
00:16:36,397 --> 00:16:37,607
I hope I didn't hurt
Tani's feelings.

330
00:16:37,687 --> 00:16:40,357
I hate this.
It's so over for me.

331
00:16:40,397 --> 00:16:41,687
[WATANABE] Suzuki!

332
00:16:41,737 --> 00:16:42,857
You're supposed to be
picking up the shuttes!

333
00:16:42,897 --> 00:16:44,107
[SATOU] With your hands.

334
00:16:46,317 --> 00:16:49,327
[SUZUKI] Why can't I ever do
anything right?

335
00:16:50,157 --> 00:16:52,537
[GIRL 3] Sorry, Suzuki.

336
00:16:52,577 --> 00:16:55,617
[bell ringing melodically]

337
00:16:57,497 --> 00:16:59,997
Talk, I have to talk.

338
00:16:59,997 --> 00:17:02,547
The longer I wait,
the worse it gets.

339
00:17:03,587 --> 00:17:06,127
But... here?

340
00:17:07,087 --> 00:17:10,887
Here, where there are people
who can perceive me?

341
00:17:11,597 --> 00:17:13,727
[breathing shakily]

342
00:17:15,267 --> 00:17:16,347
- Suzuki.
- [screaming]

343
00:17:18,017 --> 00:17:19,727
Oh. Hey, Tani.

344
00:17:22,607 --> 00:17:24,027
About yesterday.

345
00:17:24,027 --> 00:17:25,737
I'm sorry.

346
00:17:25,737 --> 00:17:27,237
Forget it happened.

347
00:17:28,487 --> 00:17:29,737
Huh?

348
00:17:42,207 --> 00:17:44,917
If we don't use this
epic popcorn coupon today,

349
00:17:44,917 --> 00:17:46,547
it's gonna expire!

350
00:17:46,587 --> 00:17:48,927
I saw you chatting it up
with Tani just now.

351
00:17:48,927 --> 00:17:50,507
The jig is up, girl.

352
00:17:50,927 --> 00:17:52,967
- Hmm?
- Are you okay?

353
00:17:53,057 --> 00:17:54,427
- [both laughing]
- No way.

354
00:17:54,467 --> 00:17:55,977
[laughing] Wait wait, wait.
Don't tell me.

355
00:17:56,057 --> 00:17:58,147
[indistinct chatter]

356
00:18:02,397 --> 00:18:03,477
[chatter fades away]

357
00:18:03,527 --> 00:18:04,937
With Tani...

358
00:18:05,277 --> 00:18:07,067
it's more than friendship.

359
00:18:07,067 --> 00:18:09,777
- I love him.
- [ALL] Hmm?

360
00:18:09,817 --> 00:18:11,907
[SUZUKI]
But I ruined everything.

361
00:18:11,947 --> 00:18:12,947
Huh?

362
00:18:13,287 --> 00:18:14,787
[SUZUKI] Yesterday,

363
00:18:14,787 --> 00:18:16,407
I worked up the courage to ask

364
00:18:16,457 --> 00:18:17,957
if we could walk home together

365
00:18:17,997 --> 00:18:19,117
and now I...

366
00:18:20,327 --> 00:18:21,667
drove him away!

367
00:18:21,707 --> 00:18:23,797
What am I supposed to do?

368
00:18:24,247 --> 00:18:25,377
Huh?

369
00:18:25,417 --> 00:18:26,797
No!

370
00:18:27,797 --> 00:18:29,087
What?! Why didn't you tell me?!

371
00:18:29,127 --> 00:18:30,467
All this time,
I thought you guys

372
00:18:30,507 --> 00:18:31,967
were regular
walking home together.

373
00:18:32,007 --> 00:18:34,847
I didn't know you were
walking home, like, together!

374
00:18:34,927 --> 00:18:37,017
Oh... Oh, my God.

375
00:18:37,097 --> 00:18:38,807
I made fun of you about this.

376
00:18:38,807 --> 00:18:40,227
I'm a horrible person.

377
00:18:41,227 --> 00:18:42,357
Dude. We know. Shut up.

378
00:18:43,147 --> 00:18:45,857
So is it bad
that Tani already left?

379
00:18:45,937 --> 00:18:47,027
[exclaims] Very bad.

380
00:18:47,107 --> 00:18:48,857
You might catch him if you run.

381
00:18:48,947 --> 00:18:51,367
Gotta fight for love!
Get your man!

382
00:18:51,407 --> 00:18:52,697
[SUZUKI] I'm goin'!

383
00:18:53,867 --> 00:18:56,537
Don't worry about the popcorn.
We'll eat it without you.

384
00:18:56,577 --> 00:18:57,827
[SUZUKI] That's fine,
I don't care.

385
00:18:57,867 --> 00:18:59,117
Noice!

386
00:19:00,287 --> 00:19:01,417
[YAMADA] Go, Suzuki!

387
00:19:01,457 --> 00:19:03,667
You better not put
your name to shame!

388
00:19:03,707 --> 00:19:06,127
[WATANABE] Rev that engine,
car girl!

389
00:19:06,167 --> 00:19:08,217
- [engine revving]
- [yelling]

390
00:19:08,297 --> 00:19:09,297
SLOW SLOW SLOW

391
00:19:09,337 --> 00:19:10,757
Oh. She's slow.

392
00:19:10,837 --> 00:19:12,177
[Suzuki panting]

393
00:19:12,217 --> 00:19:13,967
Keep trying, girl!

394
00:19:14,007 --> 00:19:16,257
- Push it! Let's go!
- Faster.

395
00:19:19,477 --> 00:19:21,017
[SUZUKI] I'm in shock.

396
00:19:21,057 --> 00:19:22,307
[screaming]

397
00:19:23,607 --> 00:19:26,017
Saying how I feel out loud

398
00:19:26,017 --> 00:19:29,147
has been this easy
the whole time?

399
00:19:41,577 --> 00:19:43,327
[TANI] I gave in to temptation.

400
00:19:43,377 --> 00:19:44,457
That's the whole story.

401
00:19:45,417 --> 00:19:47,877
She always talks to me
at school,

402
00:19:47,877 --> 00:19:49,917
but that's just banter.

403
00:19:50,007 --> 00:19:52,337
She doesn't care
about me personally.

404
00:19:52,377 --> 00:19:55,047
I just happen to sit
next to her in class.

405
00:19:57,057 --> 00:20:00,307
Would you mind if
I walked along with you?

406
00:20:00,347 --> 00:20:03,227
[TANI] Or that's what
I used to believe.

407
00:20:04,227 --> 00:20:05,307
[sighs]

408
00:20:11,567 --> 00:20:12,697
[Suzuki panting]

409
00:20:17,577 --> 00:20:19,077
[TANI] Today, I thought

410
00:20:19,117 --> 00:20:20,827
she might not come to school.

411
00:20:21,327 --> 00:20:23,327
It's not like that, dude!

412
00:20:25,247 --> 00:20:26,627
[TANI] It felt strange.

413
00:20:26,667 --> 00:20:29,247
I've gotten so used
to Suzuki talking to me.

414
00:20:29,297 --> 00:20:30,457
[panting]

415
00:20:31,837 --> 00:20:33,467
[TANI] A day without her...

416
00:20:33,507 --> 00:20:34,627
[SUZUKI] Tani!

417
00:20:34,677 --> 00:20:35,757
...is just too quiet.

418
00:20:35,797 --> 00:20:37,217
I...

419
00:20:37,217 --> 00:20:42,557
love you!

420
00:20:42,597 --> 00:20:44,807
[Suzuki panting heavily]

421
00:20:49,937 --> 00:20:51,737
I... I'm sorry

422
00:20:51,777 --> 00:20:54,107
for always talking
about stupid stuff

423
00:20:54,147 --> 00:20:55,527
to get your attention.

424
00:20:57,067 --> 00:20:58,777
I'm sorry for what I said
in class.

425
00:20:58,827 --> 00:21:00,617
I really didn't mean it
like that.

426
00:21:01,747 --> 00:21:02,947
I just...

427
00:21:02,947 --> 00:21:05,117
I didn't know
how to talk to you, Tani,

428
00:21:05,617 --> 00:21:07,877
and I was afraid of
what everyone would think

429
00:21:07,957 --> 00:21:09,667
if they found out how I felt.

430
00:21:11,247 --> 00:21:14,297
I am so beyond totally lame.

431
00:21:15,257 --> 00:21:16,337
But I...

432
00:21:16,837 --> 00:21:19,177
I want to spend
more time with you,

433
00:21:19,257 --> 00:21:21,257
more than anything in the world.

434
00:21:21,807 --> 00:21:24,767
And I was so happy
when you held my hand,

435
00:21:24,807 --> 00:21:26,307
I thought I was dreaming.

436
00:21:26,347 --> 00:21:27,647
I couldn't sleep,

437
00:21:27,687 --> 00:21:30,317
that's why I ended up
being so late for school.

438
00:21:30,357 --> 00:21:33,357
I mean, I did sleep,
but at the wrong times.

439
00:21:33,397 --> 00:21:34,897
[TANI] Hmm...

440
00:21:38,487 --> 00:21:39,657
Hey, Suzuki.

441
00:21:40,157 --> 00:21:42,117
- Uh-huh?
- Listen...

442
00:21:42,577 --> 00:21:45,577
When you're not talking,
I don't know what to say.

443
00:21:45,907 --> 00:21:48,207
I'm not good with conversation.

444
00:21:48,287 --> 00:21:52,127
I guess that's how
beyond totally lame I am.

445
00:21:54,377 --> 00:21:57,337
Is that okay with you?

446
00:21:58,887 --> 00:22:00,217
[gasps]

447
00:22:00,927 --> 00:22:03,427
That face you're making
is so adorable!

448
00:22:03,467 --> 00:22:04,557
[TANI] Whoa, there.

449
00:22:04,597 --> 00:22:06,767
What do you want me to say?

450
00:22:07,807 --> 00:22:09,897
Isn't it obvious by now?!

451
00:22:09,937 --> 00:22:12,187
[wailing]

452
00:22:12,227 --> 00:22:15,237
Sorry. I feel like
I made you cry.

453
00:22:15,777 --> 00:22:18,197
Well, yeah.
You kind of did, so...

454
00:22:18,447 --> 00:22:19,867
- [TANI] Uh...
- [SUZUKI] Huh?

455
00:22:19,907 --> 00:22:22,237
Right. You're wearing mascara.

456
00:22:22,327 --> 00:22:23,867
I shouldn't rub it.

457
00:22:23,907 --> 00:22:25,827
[exclaims]

458
00:22:25,867 --> 00:22:29,537
You really listening to me
all this time, weren't you?!

459
00:22:29,577 --> 00:22:30,747
No way!

460
00:22:30,787 --> 00:22:33,207
- My heart is all fluttery!
- Huh? Fluttery?

461
00:22:33,207 --> 00:22:34,337
Are you okay?

462
00:22:34,337 --> 00:22:36,837
[screams]

463
00:22:36,877 --> 00:22:39,047
[♪ closing theme song playing]
